{"id": "vd1", "act": "verdict", "body": "Fictional person C: the audit's verdict is 4, rule-property divergence. Apply P2 faithfully and correctly: a fish records nothing, so the captain is outside the rule. Ask the property (g1:pr1): did throwing these fish overboard destroy something the investigation needed as evidence? Yes, and only these fish could have shown the offence (l1). The rule, read as P2, gives the wrong answer about the very thing it exists to protect. That is more than a real disagreement about words: one reading fails the property. I do not adopt the runs' proposal of 2.", "author": "C (fictional prosecutor)", "kind": "person", "value": "4", "object": "g1 (for A):q1", "absent": null, "sources": [], "rests": ["C (fictional prosecutor):l1", "C (fictional prosecutor):h1", "C (fictional prosecutor):h2", "g1 (for A):pr1", "g1 (for A):p2"], "answers": [], "about": null, "narrows": null, "withdraws": null, "reason": null, "procedure": null, "via": null, "log": "C (fictional prosecutor)", "prev": "d0a67b84c32d5107adf770c21abe15d92a7e3f0a24a8e20c80797684441c9e35", "rest_hashes": ["6fba5c3eaf8d90682027dd41bc2a31940844a03751a94f3cdd721cefcf5609ce", "20f28ef3d345bf7aeb6b2cf071c17efcfdd9b107ce037656720e9f275bebcad7", "d0a67b84c32d5107adf770c21abe15d92a7e3f0a24a8e20c80797684441c9e35", "d637bf4fdf7b5bd70bdaa9585d11bc2b1ce58d27f5b3fc0ef98951edc685d85b", "920ecd1fc3551f34f30f69d7eb6f2ac3ebc9e2e4ef5cce3c3faedf26963297aa"], "hash": "b53793f2d1a80a188dde828d277bf768c4f6b095dd68bb7b3075de9071f4f61e", "sig": "1158a9fa073945b9470586022a41d071737f4beb6cc3d4bb89688d65570bcbde1fb608ddd4bd5462921e23ef82aa86fe88e936c05ea137bc2e073fe3ca6f7009"}
